DESCRIPTION:Flag Day falls on June 14\, the anniversary of the 1777 resolut
 ion in which the Continental Congress declared that the flag of the United
  States be thirteen stripes and thirteen stars. The observance is far youn
 ger than the flag\, and its origin is contested: three men have been calle
 d the father of Flag Day by sources as official as Congress and the Common
 wealth of Pennsylvania.\n\nhttps://todaycelebrates.com/holiday/flag-day/
